l-GETC Areas 1-6 with 'C' or better. Bachelor's-degree holders are deemed to have satisfied GE/graduation competency (per map). Early Childhood Education - Child Development, ECE Emphasis, People & Society Meta Majors. tccns mirrors SCC local course codes (California community colleges do not use TCCNS).",
